      "patch_payload": {
        "candidate_id": "C_7b50fd168f10a70f_1",
        "edit": "Changed the four case-branch assignments from nonblocking (<=) to blocking (=) so the combinational mux output updates within the same evaluation, eliminating the one-cycle delayed value mismatch on out.",
